# Large binary documents are stored via Git LFS.
*.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Figure-research snapshots use size-based LFS selection rather than blanket
# extension rules. Exact paths for files above the chosen threshold are added
# by tools/import_figure_review_history.py or by the figure-finalization workflow.
# Small PNG/JPEG/JSON files therefore remain ordinary Git objects and keep the
# most useful history/diff behavior.
